WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.588
Tom and Cat ran back to the Throne Room.

2
00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:20.374
Tom pointed his wand at the frogs.

3
00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:25.584
He mumbled some strange words.

4
00:00:25.585 --> 00:00:29.286
"Huh?" the king shouted.

5
00:00:29.287 --> 00:00:41.025
Poof! The frogs turned back into princes!

6
00:00:41.026 --> 00:00:44.074
"You were right, Cat!" Tom said.

7
00:00:44.075 --> 00:00:46.766
"I said the spell backwards.

8
00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:49.809
And it worked!"

9
00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:53.626
"Ahem." Princess Mary cleared her throat.

10
00:00:53.627 --> 00:00:56.163
Everyone looked at her.

11
00:00:56.164 --> 00:00:59.692
"I watched the princes while they were frogs.

12
00:00:59.693 --> 00:01:01.861
And I learned a lot."

13
00:01:01.862 --> 00:01:05.351
She pointed to the two fierce princes.

14
00:01:05.352 --> 00:01:08.198
"You fight too much!"

15
00:01:08.199 --> 00:01:11.957
She pointed to the prince who ate lots of flies.

16
00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:15.088
"You are too greedy!"

17
00:01:15.089 --> 00:01:18.017
She looked at the prince who was hiding.

18
00:01:18.018 --> 00:01:23.280
"You are too shy!"

19
00:01:23.281 --> 00:01:26.732
Then she pointed to the prince who was glaring.

20
00:01:26.733 --> 00:01:29.700
"You are too angry!"

21
00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:32.730
"Father," Princess Mary said.

22
00:01:32.731 --> 00:01:39.607
"I cannot marry any of these princes."

23
00:01:39.608 --> 00:01:43.236
The king sighed.

24
00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:46.156
"I want you to be happy.

25
00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:58.085
You must wait until you meet the right prince."

26
00:01:58.086 --> 00:02:01.897
"Thank you, Wizard!" Princess Mary said.

27
00:02:01.898 --> 00:02:08.691
She gave Tom a quick kiss.

28
00:02:08.692 --> 00:02:11.294
Dirk scowled.

29
00:02:11.295 --> 00:02:15.887
"Isn't Tom going to the Grim Dungeon?" he asked.

30
00:02:15.888 --> 00:02:18.984
"Of course not," the king said.

31
00:02:18.985 --> 00:02:34.414
"Tom cast a wonderful spell!"

32
00:02:34.415 --> 00:02:37.260
Tom smiled and petted Cat.

33
00:02:37.261 --> 00:02:40.902
Someday Princess Mary would find a prince.

34
00:02:40.903 --> 00:02:50.768
"But not yet," he thought happily.

